    "en": {
      "trackName": "Match Game - Fruit and Candy",
      "description": "The match-3 puzzle game built for your wrist.\n\nMatch Game - Fruit and Candy brings a satisfying puzzle action to Apple Watch. Swap fruits to make rows and columns of three or more — then watch the cascades rack up combos and chain reactions you never saw coming.\n\n50 levels across 5 tiers\nFrom breezy warm-ups to Expert showdowns that demand every move counts. Each level has a score target and a move limit — finish within your moves to earn up to 3 stars.\n\nSpecial tiles that change everything\nHit a big match and you might create a row blaster, column blaster, bomb, cross star, lightning strike, or rainbow candy. String them together in a cascade and watch the whole board explode.\n\nCombos & cascades\nEvery time a cleared board refills and triggers another match, your multiplier climbs. Two matches side by side? Bonus points. Deep cascade chains? Massive points.\n\nSkins\nPlay with Classic fruits, a Lunch spread, or a box of Donuts.\n\nGo Pro for a one-time purchase and get unlimited tries (no energy limit), all skins unlocked, and one revive per level — so a bad run doesn't have to end your game.\n\nOptimized for Apple Watch with a crisp OLED display, haptic feedback, and controls designed for a small screen.",
